====== T-Home Speedport W 723V Typ B ======
The T-Home Speedport W 723V Typ B (VGV8539JW22) is an IAD sold by Deutsche Telekom with an ADSL2+/VDSL2 modem, 802.11abgn wifi and two FXS ports as well as a S0 bus connector. The device is manufactured by Arcadyan.

| {{:meta:icons:tango:48px-emblem-progress.svg.png?nolink}} | This device is **not supported** yet.|

===== Supported Versions =====
|{{:meta:icons:tango:48px-dialog-warning.svg.png?nolink}}| There are two **very different** verions of this device. This article refers to **Typ B** of this device. Please check the label on the back of your device! |

^ Version/Model   ^ Launch Date   ^ S/N   ^ OpenWrt Version Supported   ^ Model Specific Notes       ^
| Typ A           |       -       | -     |        not supported        |                            |
| Typ B           |       -       | -     |        not supported        | Manufactured by Arcadyan   |

There is a U-Boot tarball available [[http://hilfe.telekom.de/dlp/eki/downloads/Speedport/Speedport%20W%20723V%20Typ%20B/u-boot-1.1.5.gz|U-Boot tarball]]. The device is shipped with **brnboot**.

